    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law and the parks, recreation and historic\npreservation law, in relation to authorizing the pass-through or transfer of\nthe credits for rehabilitation of historic properties",
    "basePrintNo": "S2124",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2124-2025",
